  "tenantRightsSheet09a76cb1": "Your rights as tenants",
  "tenantRightsSheet26a4104a": "The deposit is capped by law",
  "tenantRightsSheet5ea0f907": "Under the 2017 Fair Rental Law, a cash/guarantee deposit is ",
  "tenantRightsSheet998fde48": "capped at ₪{cap}. That's the maximum you can be asked for ",
  "tenantRightsSheetDaadfc3a": "for this property (the lower of ⅓ of the total rent for the ",
  "tenantRightsSheet30650421": "term or 3 months' rent).\n\n",
  "tenantRightsSheet74e1f7e7": "Security = money or a guarantee left with the landlord ",
  "tenantRightsSheetFd0085dc": "to secure the agreement, and is returned at the end of the lease.",
  "tenantRightsSheet8bed726a": "capped at the lower of ⅓ of the total rent for the term or ",
  "tenantRightsSheetC9040c39": "3 months' rent.",
  "tenantRightsSheet331175e3": "Brokerage fee — only if you signed",
  "tenantRightsSheetC9a8fc94": "A brokerage fee (one month's rent + 18% VAT) is owed to the agent ",
  "tenantRightsSheetC6aca436": "only if you signed a brokerage agreement. Without a signature — you're not required ",
  "tenantRightsSheet0ae2e28f": "to pay a brokerage fee. Always ask who represents whom.",
  "tenantRightsSheetD8e77ae9": "Don't pay before seeing the apartment",
  "tenantRightsSheet386b9b05": "Never transfer a deposit, advance, or brokerage fee before ",
  "tenantRightsSheetC75c0e1f": "you've visited the apartment in person and verified who you're dealing with. ",
  "tenantRightsSheetD5e1f4c7": "A request for advance payment \"to hold\" the apartment is a red flag.",
  "tenantRightsSheet8b33be3a": "A habitable apartment",
  "tenantRightsSheet6c2e4b93": "The landlord must hand over an apartment in habitable condition and repair ",
  "tenantRightsSheet7be24327": "significant defects that aren't your fault. An apartment must have ventilation, ",
  "tenantRightsSheetD89c29b2": "water, electricity, and a working sewage system.\n\n",
  "tenantRightsSheet5e967f01": "Mamad = a protected residential space, a safe room. If it exists, ",
  "tenantRightsSheet18d2dbed": "it must not be used as storage that blocks access in an emergency.",
  "tenantRightsSheetF8a977ee": "General information, not legal advice. If in doubt, consult ",
  "tenantRightsSheet190074d2": "a lawyer.",
  "tenantRightsSheet5e9909a0": "Got it",
